  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色金融與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "GREEN FINANCE AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程從全球治理及政治經濟學的視角來討探永續金融及ESG的發展。這門課的結構可分作兩大部分。課程第一部分主要關注永續金融在制度層次上的設計、運作及影響，涵蓋主題包括永續金融的概念發展、碳交易市場的設計、中央銀行的角色、綠色債券及社會影響債券的運作，以及針對歐盟、亞洲國家和台灣的個案研究。課程的第二部分則是聚焦ESG在企業層次上的運作及影響。本課程除課堂授課外，也包含專題演講及機構參訪，以期增進修課同學對個案及實務的理解。",
    "describe_eh": "This course explores the development of sustainable finance and ESG from the perspectives of global governance and political economy. The structure of this course can be divided into two parts. The first part of the course focuses on the design, operation and impact of sustainable finance at the institutional level, covering topics such as the conceptual development of sustainable finance, the design of carbon trading markets, the role of central banks, the operation of green bonds and social impact bonds, and Case studies for the European Union, Asian countries and Taiwan. The second part of the course focuses on the operation and impact of ESG at the corporate level. In addition to classroom lectures, this course also includes special lectures and institutional visits to enhance students' understanding of case studies and practice.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解永續金融及ESG的學術研究及實務，並能應用核心概念及現有的分析架構",
      "describe_en": "Understand the academic research and practice of sustainable finance and ESG, and be able to apply core concepts and existing analytical frameworks"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能對學術論文進行批判性思考，檢視其假設及方法，並反思新的可能性",
      "describe_en": "Ability to think critically about academic papers, examine their assumptions and methods, and reflect on new possibilities"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能在課堂中清晰地表達自己的觀點，並與持不同觀點者進行理性的討論",
      "describe_en": "Ability to express one's views clearly in class and conduct rational discussions with those who hold different views"
    }
  ],
